# history-preserve-point: the remembered point carries over to the next
# readline() call (it is the point of the accepted line).
tags: history history-preserve-point
--- inputrc
set history-preserve-point on
--- script
add_history "x y z"
add_history "second"
readline "> " 2 addhist
history_dump

=== preserve-point-from-accepted-line
keys: yé\sa\M-b<pause>\C-p<pause><dump>b/日b\sx\r<pause>\C-p<dump>\r

=== preserve-point-after-history-line
keys: 01yy1\C-b<up>\r\C-p<dump>\r

=== preserve-point-accepted-at-end
keys: abc\r\C-p<dump>\r
